# Analects Book 8 (泰伯) — draft, second half: lemmata 16–32 = passages 8.11–8.21.
# Token format as the pilot:
#   tokens separated by " | "; a token is  CHARS[PUNCT][=pinyin][/context gloss[//char gloss//char gloss]]
#   a leading "^" breaks the verse line before the token.
# Punctuation is editorial (the edition has none) and always trails the word before it.
# Pinyin defaults to the glossary's first reading; every polyphone states its reading here, and so does
# every character not yet in the glossary.
# Passage numbering follows Zhu Xi's chapter breaks (the ○ marks agree with 8.11–8.21): 8.13 runs over
# three units, 8.19 over two, 8.20 over four (Zhu Xi records a view that 三分天下… should be its own
# chapter; we keep it in 8.20 as he prints it).
# Quotation marks balance within every unit; a saying that runs on past one of Zhu Xi's interruptions
# (8.13, 8.19, 8.20 last unit) is left unquoted in the continuing unit, as 7.25.
# Glyphs kept as the edition prints them: 宫 (= 宮, 8.21), 閒 (= 間, read jiàn, 8.21).
# Readings Zhu Xi marks that modern practice does not keep: 侗 (音通, tōng; we give tóng, 8.16).
# Kept: 易 yì (8.12, 去聲), 好 hào (8.13), 見 xiàn (8.13, 賢遍反), 摯 zhì, 悾 kōng, 與 yù (8.18, 去聲),
# 治 zhì (8.20, 去聲), 閒 jiàn (去聲), 菲 fěi (音匪), 黻 fú (音弗), 洫 xù (呼域反).
# 8.20 ends 其可謂至德也已矣, as 8.1 (lemma 0): the English of that clause is kept the same in both.

